#NEXUS

[ norman2020b_fig24: Cladogram of five higher taxa, read by eye; the tips are clade names. Sauropodomorpha, Ornithoscelida and Dinosauria, printed beside bars on the stems of their nodes, are kept as internal labels; 'no gastralia' marks a character shared by the Sauropoda and Ornithischia stems and is not a clade. Fully resolved. 5 tips, fully resolved; 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 7 case (census 2, seed 20261241). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=5;
    TAXLABELS
        Dinosauromorpha
        Prosauropoda
        Sauropoda
        Ornithischia
        Theropoda
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE norman2020b_fig24 = [&R] (Dinosauromorpha,((Prosauropoda,Sauropoda)Sauropodomorpha,(Ornithischia,Theropoda)Ornithoscelida)Dinosauria);
END;
